        "original_id": "5fbe074a-9fee-530e-8a3a-98800b584eed",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kim Roberts\n- Works: The Handmaid's Tale, Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs, Schitt's Creek, The Strain, Lucky Seven, Being Erica, The Doodlebops, I'm Not There, Saw III, Saw IV, The Cheetah Girls\n- Organizations: FX\n- Topics: Canadian actresses, American horror drama television series\n\nFacts:\n- Kim Roberts is a Canadian actress.\n- Kim Roberts played Mrs. Bosco in The Cheetah Girls in 2003.\n- Kim Roberts played Mazz in The Doodlebops from 2005 to 2006.\n- Kim Roberts played Deborah in Saw III in 2006.\n- Kim Roberts played Mrs. Arvin in I'm Not There in 2007.\n- Kim Roberts played Deborah in Saw IV in 2007.\n- Kim Roberts played Camilla in Being Erica in 2010.\n- Kim Roberts played Gloria in Lucky Seven in 2013.\n- The Strain is an American horror drama television series that premiered on FX on July 13, 2014.\n- Kim Roberts played Neeva in The Strain in 2014.\n- Kim Roberts played Marnie in Schitt's Creek in 2015.\n- Kim Roberts played Christine in The Handmaid's Tale in 2017.\n- Kim Roberts played Regina in Cloudy with a Chance of Meatballs in 2017.",
